ak"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どう？\nおいしそうでしょ(*´ `*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後にっ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日 乃木のの収録の時に\n３つハワイのクッキーをもらったの♪\nストロベリー味と ココアとプレーン。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クッキーぱくっ とね(*´ω｀*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2013/10/23/5481267/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう.皆 大好きだよ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなちゃい. Rotty"}],"source":"archive"}